        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yakobo aca abarira abiwe n’ abari kumwe na we bose, ati Ni mukūreh’ ibigirwamana vy’abanyamahanga biri muri mwebge, mwihumanure, mwambare izindi mpuzu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.2",
